decided to never see each other again.

265
00:15:39,380 --> 00:15:43,980
So one rules under the sun, from six
in the morning to six in the evening.

266
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:49,184
And the other rules under the moon, from
six in the evening to six in the morning.

267
00:15:51,380 --> 00:15:55,200
Thus divided, the two kings ensure
that they never cross paths.

268
00:15:55,540 --> 00:15:58,011
I wonder how it got that bad between them.

269
00:16:00,420 --> 00:16:01,250
Ah!

270
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:03,461
Even his doctors go to sleep too?

271
00:16:03,980 --> 00:16:07,360
It's not only his doctors,
but everyone in the fortress.

272
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:16,780
I'm starting to nod off.

273
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:19,877
Hey, that lion bro is...

274
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:20,900
It's Cecilion!

275
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:22,540
Always at full power!

276
00:16:22,880 --> 00:16:24,939
Okay, you don't have to yell at me!

277
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:30,100
The country follows a day and night
cycle, just like the two kings.

278
00:16:30,460 --> 00:16:34,317
So those who live in the city are
active during the daylight hours.

279
00:16:34,400 --> 00:16:36,620
and those who live in the forest

280
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:40,400
are not terrible like me.

281
00:16:44,940 --> 00:16:46,400
Keep searching.

282
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:49,560
I know Race is hiding somewhere.

283
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,640
Stop it!

284
00:16:52,020 --> 00:16:54,257
Haven't you thug done
enough damage already?

285
00:16:54,340 --> 00:16:55,516
This is getting bad.

286
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:58,500
Where's the samurai, doggie? Not here.

287
00:16:58,760 --> 00:17:00,217
I promise you...

288
00:17:00,300 --> 00:17:01,877
Too bad.

289
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,140
You're useless.

290
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,511
Here come the musketeers!

291
00:17:10,100 --> 00:17:12,000
Huh? All right!

292
00:17:12,320 --> 00:17:13,677
Everyone else step back!

293
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:15,289
They're gonna handle this!

294
00:17:17,060 --> 00:17:18,880
Focus on disarming the enemy!

295
00:17:19,220 --> 00:17:22,240
Our goal is to minimize the damage! Sir!

296
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:24,817
Carrot, are you ready?

297
00:17:24,900 --> 00:17:25,730
Uh-huh!

298
00:17:43,300 --> 00:17:45,060
What are these people?

299
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,580
They're creepy.

300
00:17:52,820 --> 00:17:55,280
Some have disturbing powers.

301
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:57,880
A race that we don't know?

302
00:17:58,180 --> 00:18:00,440
I fear they are something unnatural.

303
00:18:02,420 --> 00:18:04,714
Watch out for the ones with blackhorns!

304
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,260
Try my wolf grip!

305
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:09,740
What did he do?

306
00:18:10,060 --> 00:18:11,020
Now die!

307
00:18:12,140 --> 00:18:13,840
Wonder be countered!

308
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:17,220
You gotta step back!

309
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:19,520
They're in trouble now!

310
00:18:27,420 --> 00:18:28,250
Woohoo!

311
00:18:28,333 --> 00:18:29,440
The three musketeers!

312
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:35,240
All of the musketeers, lead the
citizens to the forest immediately! Sir!

313
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:44,060
More insects to squash.

314
00:19:11,700 --> 00:19:17,180
So you Karoo Jack, stop all of this
violence and destruction at once.

315
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:25,040
You must be the ruler.

316
00:19:47,780 --> 00:19:49,360
I'm confused, sir.

317
00:19:49,620 --> 00:19:50,796
Why drop your blade?

318
00:19:52,420 --> 00:19:54,457
I shall not take up arms.

319
00:19:54,540 --> 00:19:57,300
This samurai is not here.

320
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:01,600
You, Karoo, are free to search
and find out for yourself.

321
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:03,605
But let it be done peacefully.

322
00:20:05,860 --> 00:20:08,260
I won't see our heritage destroyed.

323
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:09,760
I refuse!

324
00:20:12,540 --> 00:20:14,599
Don't just stand there for the way!

325
00:20:19,340 --> 00:20:20,940
Oh no, the poor Duke!

326
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:44,600
hold up what's with that dog guy he
stood there and didn't even flinch

327
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:50,657
that's our duke stout-hearted
and true i didn't realize they

328
00:20:50,740 --> 00:20:55,540
had a guy this strong I thought this place
was full of fuzzy, woodland creatures!

329
00:20:59,500 --> 00:21:01,040
Don't make me laugh!

330
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:03,537
You really think you're that tough, huh?

331
00:21:03,620 --> 00:21:05,577
You're up against Master Jack here!

332
00:21:05,660 --> 00:21:06,778
He's feared by all!

333
00:21:07,480 --> 00:21:13,620
Surely you know the bounty on his head
alone is worth one billion berries?

334
00:21:17,380 --> 00:21:22,197
So just because you're a little strong
don't think you can push your lock,

335
00:21:22,280 --> 00:21:23,357
that's enough.

336
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:28,197
Blabbing about me, believe me:

337
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:30,757
we speak the truth;

338
00:21:30,840 --> 00:21:33,257
we are not concealing the samurai.

339
00:21:33,340 --> 00:21:35,157
I'm gonna make this clear.

340
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:41,497
Your greatest sin is protecting
Rhizo—if you can't find him,

341
00:21:41,580 --> 00:21:42,797
it's your own fault.

342
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:45,957
He's an insane monster.

343
00:21:46,040 --> 00:21:46,870
And

344
00:21:49,100 --> 00:21:51,057
one more thing.

345
00:21:51,140 --> 00:21:54,077
I revel in destruction.

346
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:54,990
This

347
00:21:59,240 --> 00:22:00,617
is a disaster!

348
00:22:00,700 --> 00:22:01,530
disaster

349
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:10,100
Onward!

350
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:26,740
Oh, that rain it was.

351
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:36,320
Goloniago!

352
00:22:38,260 --> 00:22:39,100
Yaaah!

353
00:22:42,600 --> 00:22:45,200
That sounded like master cat viper's roar.

354
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:51,540
The fool of the night has come to
play, then it's time to retreat.

355
00:22:52,940 --> 00:22:54,477
Shouldn't we fight with them?

356
00:22:54,560 --> 00:22:57,517
Fall back; switching off
will be to our benefit.

357
00:22:57,600 --> 00:23:01,077
The enemy will weaken after
not being able to rest.

358
00:23:01,160 --> 00:23:04,277
Oh, I get it, jack;

359
00:23:04,360 --> 00:23:09,080
do not believe that you Karoo
are the only stubborn one here.

360
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:13,100
Here, for every nation
has its share of fools.

361
00:23:29,580 --> 00:23:30,410
Bolognago!

362
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:34,800
When the moon goes up, this is my turn!

363
00:23:35,220 --> 00:23:37,780
No intruder will escape on my watch!

364
00:23:42,720 --> 00:23:45,220
Entering my home while I sleep!

365
00:23:45,600 --> 00:23:47,900
He sleeps, Monster Kitty!

366
00:24:02,360 --> 00:24:03,500
Master Jack!

367
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:06,318
We have so much to tell you, Grove!

368
00:24:06,420 --> 00:24:09,008
Yeah, yeah, I already
heard the whole story.

369
00:24:10,480 --> 00:24:14,186
So, if I got this straight, you're
looking for a water warrior.

370
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:20,080
I wouldn't let a samurai step
a damn foot on this island.

371
00:24:20,340 --> 00:24:25,280
And if one even dared, I would chew
through every limb on his body.

372
00:24:26,840 --> 00:24:31,700
I'm the fearless cat viper, the man
who waits for the god of the world.

373
00:24:52,620 --> 00:24:54,700
Master Charge!

374
00:25:09,080 --> 00:25:09,910
Thank you.
